    "updated_at": "2020-05-11T16:04:28Z",
    "body": "Ah, okay, thanks! I see there's a bug in the test file I used, so I didn't test the fullscreen mode correctly. \r\n\r\nI used [this file](https://gist.github.com/sefeng211/b3359e2c21c4e4c74e3f7cdaed90164b). Redoing the test, I see Chrome returned `null` when it's in fullscreen, and firefox returned `body`. \r\n\r\nDoes this still look like a bug on Chrome?\r\n",
