    "created_at": "2020-05-11T18:18:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-05-11T18:18:09Z",
    "body": "It should return `<body>` per spec as long as the dialog is a descendant of the body in the flat tree (though in fairness it's not a terribly useful behavior).\r\n\r\nHowever it should behave consistently with fixed-pos elements and such, and I expect stuff to be interoperable there.",
