    "updated_at": "2020-05-12T19:56:05Z",
    "body": "Great! OK, then combined with @emilio's assessment, I'm going to say the spec is correct as-is, and Chrome has a bug.\r\n\r\n@sefeng211, can you help make sure that both fullscreen and modal dialog are covered by web platform tests (fixing any broken ones you find), and add links to them here? Then I can take care of filing a Chromium bug, and we can close this spec issue.",
